This is the latest version of my SANE module.  However, it's also been
incorporated in Fredrik Lundh's Python Imaging Library (PIL), which is
required to use the SANE module.  Unless I've privately informed you
of a bugfix to the SANE module, I recommend that you download from
http://www.pythonware.com/products/pil/ and install it to use SANE
with Python.

